=== file: README.md ===
# Generate and deduplicate test ideas

This workflow asks a person to confirm the provider and its data-handling terms before sending a potentially proprietary function description to a model. An unsure or denied confirmation stops the run without sending the description.

After confirmation, `TestIdeaGenerator` creates structured test ideas and `TestIdeaDeduplicator` removes duplicates while preserving distinct coverage. The final list is returned to the caller; the workflow does not write files or send messages.

Both agents use the plan's `gpt-6-luna` model with separate, versioned prompt files. The workflow budget is 8,000 tokens and three calls. Structured-output correction is the only correction attempt; failures stop processing and do not return a partial list.

Run the checks with:

```text
weave check main.loom --no-env
weave test main.loom
```
